 "status": "ACTIVE",
 "descriptionHtml": "<p>Yamato Full-Face Forged Wedge Set or Single, 50/52/54/56/58/60 Gap and Sand, is a right-handed forged wedge offering with full-face grooves. It is sold as a combination of 2 or 3 wedges with lofts between 50° and 60°.</p>\n<h3>Highlights</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Choose a combination: 52°, 56° and 60° (Rainbow, Black or Silver); 50°, 54° and 58° (Black); or two wedges in Black: 52° and 56°, 52° and 60°, or 56° and 60°.</li>\n<li>Full-face grooves.</li>\n<li>Leading edge designed to prevent digging into the ground.</li>\n<li>Stainless steel shaft with rubber grip.</li>\n</ul>",
